      "(3) Him",
      "",
      "It starts raining. Leng Xiaoxi does not have an umbrella. She goes to the milk tea store.",
      "She sees three cats in front of the milk tea store.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi recognizes these three cats.",
      "Previously they liked to sleep in front of the little store and also liked to sleep in front of the little restaurant.",
      "",
      "Now the three cats are eating. A male student is giving them things to eat.",
      "It is raining heavily. The male student is holding up an umbrella for the cats.",
      "",
      "“Hello!” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "“He … hello,” the male student says.",
      "",
      "“Do you like cats?” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "“Yes, I … I really like them. You also like cats, right?” the male student says.",
      "",
      "“I really like cats! I know all the cats in Xijing University,” Leng Xiaoxi says."
